\end_inset

 are non-negative homogenous of degree one, and 
\begin_inset Formula $y\in\mathbb{R}^{N}\mapsto W(y)\equiv\sum_{i\in N}\alpha_{i}\ln(y^{i})$
\end_inset

.
 Let 
