\begin{eqnarray*}
\max & W(u_{1}(x^{1}(p,w^{1})),\ldots,u_{n}(x^{n}(p,w^{n}))\\
\mbox{s.t.} & (w^{i})_{i\in N}\in\mathbb{R}_{+}^{N},\ \sum_{i\in N}w^{i}=w
\end{eqnarray*}

\end_inset

if and only if it solves
\begin_inset Formula 
\begin{eqnarray*}
\max & \sum_{i\in N}\alpha_{i}\ln(w^{i})\\
\mbox{s.t.} & (w^{i})_{i\in N}\in\mathbb{R}_{+}^{N},\ \sum_{i\in N}w^{i}=w
\end{eqnarray*}

\end_inset

Use KT FOC to prove that 
